From cac639bb64757d61f965100240c4c912fcc6b62b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aeon <171243930+aeon1911@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:58:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/51] Drop Project Brutality-only behavior from the Switch
 port.

The launcher no longer treats a filename containing brutal or pb as
Project Brutality, and it no longer injects pb_* or nashgore_* cvars
or the shot-effect option. Class-name effect thinning is gone, so
Brutal Doom, Lexicon, Trailblazer and Samsara keep their own actors.
SD cache, async loading, prefetch, shader variants, the loading
screen, the 30 FPS lock, core pinning and the logs stay.
